      *================================================================*
      *                    2400-VALIDA-PRODUTO                         *
      * BUSCA LA TASA POLITICA VIGENTE DEL PRODUCTO Y SUBPRODUCTO DADO *
      *================================================================*
       2400-VALIDA-PRODUTO.
      *
           MOVE '2400-VALIDA-PRODUTO     ' TO WS-CONTENIDO-TOT(01:)
           PERFORM 2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS
      *
           MOVE CT-01                    TO SITP-E-OPCION
           MOVE CT-96                    TO SITP-E-PRODUC
           MOVE UGSI-SUBPRODUC           TO SITP-E-SUBPRO
           MOVE UGSI-TRAZA               TO SITP-E-TRAZA
           MOVE UGSI-VALORSOLICITUD      TO SITP-E-MONTO
           MOVE CT-20                    TO SITP-PLAZO(1:2)
           MOVE UGSI-NUMCUOTAS(2:)       TO SITP-PLAZO(3:)
      *
           MOVE WS-PUNTOS-NOMINA         TO SITP-E-PUNTOS-NOM
           MOVE WS-PUNTOS-PRODUCTOS      TO SITP-E-PUNTOS-PRO
           MOVE WS-PUNTOS-BURO           TO SITP-E-PUNTOS-BURO
           MOVE WS-PUNTOS-INGRESOS       TO SITP-E-PUNTOS-INGRESOS

           EXEC CICS
               LINK PROGRAM(RUT-UG2CSITP)
               COMMAREA(UGWCSITP)
           END-EXEC
      *
           IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              MOVE CT-99                   TO UGSI-CODRETO
              MOVE 'ERROR LINK'            TO UGSI-DESCRI1
              MOVE 'UG2CSITP'              TO UGSI-DESCRI2
              PERFORM 3000-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE '2200-TRAER-TASA-POLI' TO WTRC-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'UGSI-CODRETO '        TO WTRC-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SITP-S-COD-RESPUESTA   TO WTRC-VALOR-ALF
           PERFORM 2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS
      *
           EVALUATE SITP-S-COD-RESPUESTA
              WHEN CT-00
      *COL01-I
                IF UGSI-BURO > ZEROES
                  IF UGSI-BURO >= PARAS-BURO-MINIMO
                    MOVE CT-SATISFACTORY      TO UGSI-S-SCORE
                  ELSE
                    MOVE CT-UNSATISFACTORY    TO UGSI-S-SCORE
                  END-IF
                ELSE
                  MOVE CT-UNSATISFACTORY      TO UGSI-S-SCORE
                END-IF
      *
                MOVE 'BURO MINIMO:         '  TO WS-CONTENIDO-TOT(1:20)
                MOVE  PARAS-BURO-MINIMO       TO WS-CONTENIDO-TOT(21:)
                PERFORM 2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS
      *COL01-F
                PERFORM 2320-CALCULO-CUOTAS
      * COL03-I
                IF UGSI-APLICATIVO = CTE-CYP
                   PERFORM 9999-CALCULO-COMISION
                END-IF
      * COL03-F
              WHEN CT-10
                 MOVE CT-99         TO UGSI-CODRETO
      * COL03-I
                 IF UGSI-APLICATIVO = CTE-CYP
                    MOVE SITP-S-DES-ERROR(1:20) TO UGSI-DESCRI1
                    MOVE SITP-S-DES-ERROR(21:)  TO UGSI-DESCRI2
                 END-IF
      * COL03-F
              WHEN '10'
              WHEN '99'
                 MOVE CT-99         TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 MOVE UGSI-DESCRI1  TO UGSI-DESCRI1
                 MOVE UGSI-DESCRI2  TO UGSI-DESCRI2
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE CT-99                  TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 MOVE 'ERROR AL CONSULTAR'   TO UGSI-DESCRI1
                 MOVE 'TASA POLITICA     '   TO UGSI-DESCRI2
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *                    2320-CALCULO-CUOTAS                         *
      *================================================================*
       2320-CALCULO-CUOTAS.
      *
           MOVE SPACES                         TO WS-FECHA-AMO
      *
           PERFORM 2321-DATOS-COMUNES
      *
           MOVE 1                              TO WS-IND
      * CALCULO DE CUOTA CON TASA POLITICA
           MOVE SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL            TO COT-INT-NOMINAL
           PERFORM 2311-LLAMAR-MODULO-CALC
           MOVE COT-CUOTA                      TO WS-CUOTA-POL
      * CALCULO DE CUOTA CON TASA NOMINA
           IF SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL-NOM = SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL
             MOVE WS-CUOTA-POL                 TO WS-CUOTA-NOM
           ELSE
             PERFORM 2321-DATOS-COMUNES
             MOVE SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL-NOM      TO COT-INT-NOMINAL
             PERFORM 2311-LLAMAR-MODULO-CALC
             MOVE COT-CUOTA                    TO WS-CUOTA-NOM
           END-IF
      * CALCULO DE CUOTA CON TASA PORTAFOLIO
           IF SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL-PRO = SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL
             MOVE WS-CUOTA-POL                 TO WS-CUOTA-PRO
           ELSE
             PERFORM 2321-DATOS-COMUNES
             MOVE SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL-PRO      TO COT-INT-NOMINAL
             PERFORM 2311-LLAMAR-MODULO-CALC
             MOVE COT-CUOTA                    TO WS-CUOTA-PRO
           END-IF
      * MUEVE EN LA TABLA DE SALIDA LOS DATOS DE LAS CUOTAS CALCULADAS
           PERFORM 3 TIMES
             EVALUATE WS-IND
               WHEN 1
                 MOVE CT-POLITICA         TO UGSI-S-ID         (WS-IND)
                                             UGSI-ID           (WS-IND)
                 MOVE WS-CUOTA-POL        TO UGSI-S-VALOR-CUOTA(WS-IND)
      *COL02-I
      *          MOVE SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL  TO UGSI-PORCENTAJE  (WS-IND)
                 MOVE SITP-S-TASA-POLITICA TO UGSI-PORCENTAJE  (WS-IND)
      *COL02-F
               WHEN 2
                 MOVE CT-NOMINA           TO UGSI-S-ID         (WS-IND)
                                             UGSI-ID           (WS-IND)
                 MOVE WS-CUOTA-NOM        TO UGSI-S-VALOR-CUOTA(WS-IND)
      *COL02-I
      *          MOVE SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL-NOM
                 MOVE SITP-S-TASA-POLITIC-NOM
      *COL02-F
                                          TO UGSI-PORCENTAJE   (WS-IND)
               WHEN 3
                 MOVE CT-PORTAFOLIO       TO UGSI-S-ID         (WS-IND)
                                             UGSI-ID           (WS-IND)
                 MOVE WS-CUOTA-PRO        TO UGSI-S-VALOR-CUOTA(WS-IND)
      *COL02-I
      *          MOVE SITP-S-TASA-NOMINAL-PRO
                 MOVE SITP-S-TASA-POLITIC-PRO
      *COL02-F
                                          TO UGSI-PORCENTAJE   (WS-IND)
             END-EVALUATE
      *
             MOVE UGSI-SUBPRODUC          TO UGSI-S-SUBPROD   (WS-IND)
             MOVE CT-COP                  TO UGSI-S-DIVISA    (WS-IND)
             MOVE UGSI-NUMCUOTAS          TO UGSI-S-NUMCUOTAS (WS-IND)
             MOVE UGSI-FRECUENCIA         TO UGSI-S-FRECUENCIA(WS-IND)
      *COL01-I
      *      MOVE UGSI-BURO               TO UGSI-S-BURO      (WS-IND)
      *COL01-I
      *
             ADD 1                        TO WS-IND
           END-PERFORM.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *                    2321-DATOS-COMUNES                          *
      *================================================================*
       2321-DATOS-COMUNES.
      *
           INITIALIZE URECCOT
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHOY                    TO W-FECHA-DISPLAY
           MOVE CT-N                         TO CUA-SIMULACION
           MOVE SITP-ADS-PERCAP              TO WS-CODIGO-PERIODO
           MOVE UGSI-VALORSOLICITUD          TO WS-MONTO
           MOVE WS-MONTO                     TO COT-CAPITAL
                                                COT-CAPITAL-INICIAL
           MOVE ZEROS                        TO COT-INT-EFECTIVO
           MOVE SITP-ADS-CODTIAMO            TO COT-TIP-CUOTA
           MOVE ZERO                         TO COT-AJUSTE-ENTREGAS
      *
           EVALUATE WS-CODIGO
              WHEN CT-3
                 DIVIDE CT-1           BY WS-PERIODO
                    GIVING COT-AMO-ANNO
                    REMAINDER WS-RESTO
                 END-DIVIDE
              WHEN CT-2
                 DIVIDE CT-12          BY WS-PERIODO
                    GIVING COT-AMO-ANNO
                    REMAINDER WS-RESTO
                 END-DIVIDE
                      MOVE COT-AMO-ANNO      TO WS-COT-AMO-ANNO
                      IF COT-AMO-ANNO EQUAL  WS-COT-AMO-ANNO
                         CONTINUE
                      ELSE
                         MOVE ZEROS            TO COT-AMO-ANNO
                         MOVE WS-COT-AMO-ANNO  TO COT-AMO-ANNO
                      END-IF
              WHEN CT-1
                 IF SITP-ADS-DIASCAL = CT-C OR CT-M
                    DIVIDE CT-360-COMP3          BY WS-PERIODO
                       GIVING COT-AMO-ANNO
                       REMAINDER WS-RESTO
                    END-DIVIDE
                 ELSE
                    DIVIDE CT-365-COMP3          BY WS-PERIODO
                       GIVING COT-AMO-ANNO
                       REMAINDER WS-RESTO
                    END-DIVIDE
                 END-IF
           END-EVALUATE
      *
           MOVE UGSI-NUMCUOTAS(2:)            TO COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN
           MOVE SPACES                        TO COT-ENTIOFI.
           MOVE SPACES                        TO COT-CUENTA.
           MOVE '1001'                        TO COT-PERCAPIT
      *
           IF WS-FECHA-AMO = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
             PERFORM 2311-PRIMERA-FECHA
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE WS-FECHA-AMO                  TO COT-F-AMORTI
           MOVE SITP-ADS-PERCAP               TO COT-PERCAP
           MOVE SITP-ADS-TIPODIAS             TO COT-TIPODIAS
           MOVE SITP-ADS-PERINT               TO COT-PERINT
           MOVE SITP-ADS-DIASCAL              TO COT-DIASCAL

           IF SITP-ADS-UGCDIPAG = 0
              MOVE W-DIA-DIS                  TO SITP-ADS-UGCDIPAG
           END-IF

           MOVE SITP-ADS-UGCDIPAG             TO COT-UGCDIPAG
           MOVE SITP-ADS-CODTIPRE             TO COT-CODIGO.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *             2311-PRIMERA-FECHA                                 *
      *    SE CALCULA LA FECHA DE PRIMERA AMORTIZACION.                *
      *================================================================*
       2311-PRIMERA-FECHA.
      *
           INITIALIZE URECDFP
      *
           MOVE W-DIA-DIS                     TO DFP-DIA
      *
           IF SITP-ADS-UGCDIPAG  > 0
              MOVE  SITP-ADS-UGCDIPAG         TO WS-UGCDIPAG
              MOVE  WS-UGCDIPAG               TO DFP-DIA
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE W-FECHA-DISPLAY               TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
           MOVE CT-1                          TO DFP-NUM-PERIODOS
           MOVE SITP-ADS-TIPODIAS             TO DFP-TIPODIAS
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-INICIAL             TO WS-FECHA-AMO-ANT
      *
           IF SITP-ADS-CARECAP       NOT = SPACES
              MOVE SITP-ADS-CARECAP           TO DFP-PERCAP
              PERFORM  241112-LLAMAR-RUTINA
              MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL            TO WS-FECHA-SOLICITUD
                                                 WS-FECOVALI
              MOVE WS-FECHA-SOLICITUD         TO DFP-FECHA-INICIAL
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SITP-ADS-PERCAP               TO DFP-PERCAP
      *
           PERFORM  241112-LLAMAR-RUTINA
      *
           MOVE DFP-FECHA-FINAL               TO WS-FECHA-AMO.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *               241112-LLAMAR-RUTINA.                            *
      *    SE LLAMA A LA RUTINA UR1CDFP QUE DESPLAZA FECHAS POR        *
      *    PERIODICIDAD. EN CASO DE ERROR FINALIZA LA EJECUCION.       *
      *================================================================*
       241112-LLAMAR-RUTINA.
      *
           EXEC CICS LINK
              PROGRAM (RUT-UR1CDFP0)
              COMMAREA (URECDFP)
           END-EXEC
      *
           IF DFP-CORESPUE NOT = CT-10
              MOVE CT-UGE0517                 TO UGSI-CODRETO
              MOVE RUT-UR1CDFP0               TO UGSI-DESCRI1
              MOVE '30'                       TO UGSI-CODRETO
              MOVE DFP-CORESPUE               TO UGSI-DESCRI2
              PERFORM 3000-FINAL
           END-IF.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *             2311-LLAMAR-MODULO-CALC                            *
      *   SE LLAMA A LA RUTINA DE CALCULO DE LA PRIMERA CUOTA          *
      *================================================================*
       2311-LLAMAR-MODULO-CALC.
      *
           EXEC CICS LINK
              PROGRAM (RUT-UR1CCOT0)
              COMMAREA (COT-NIVEL-01)
           END-EXEC
      *
           EVALUATE COT-CODIGO
              WHEN CT-01
                 MOVE CT-UGE0331              TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 PERFORM  3000-FINAL
              WHEN CT-98
                 PERFORM 21711-REBOSAMIENTO
              WHEN CT-47
                 MOVE CT-UGE0939              TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 MOVE '30'                       TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 MOVE 'ERROR TABLA      '     TO UGSI-DESCRI1
                 MOVE 'CORPORATIVA 552'       TO UGSI-DESCRI2
                 PERFORM  3000-FINAL
              WHEN CT-48
                 MOVE CT-UGE0939              TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 MOVE 'ERROR TABLA      '     TO UGSI-DESCRI1
                 MOVE 'CORPORATIVA 552'       TO UGSI-DESCRI2
                 PERFORM  3000-FINAL
              WHEN CT-99
                 MOVE CT-UGE0298              TO UGSI-CODRETO
                 PERFORM  3000-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *                 21711-REBOSAMIENTO                             *
      *   SE FINALIZA LA EJECUCION POR REBOSAMIENTO EN LOS CALCULOS.   *
      *================================================================*
       21711-REBOSAMIENTO.
      *
           MOVE CT-UGE0297                    TO UGSI-CODRETO
           PERFORM  3000-FINAL.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *                      2210-MUEVE-SALIDA                         *
      *================================================================*
       2900-MOVER-SALIDA.
      *
           MOVE '2900-MOVER-SALIDA  '    TO WS-CONTENIDO-TOT(01:)
           PERFORM 2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS
      *
           MOVE SITP-S-TASA-POLITICA     TO WS-CI-TEAP-LQS
      *
           MOVE 'SITP-S-DATOS-SALIDA: '  TO WS-CONTENIDO-TOT(1:20)
           MOVE  SITP-S-DATOS-SALIDA     TO WS-CONTENIDO-TOT(21:)
           PERFORM 2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *                       2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS                     *
      *       ESCRIBE COLA TS DE LOG PARA VALIDAR FUNCIONAMIENTO       *
      *================================================================*
       2990-ESCRIBE-COLA-TS.
      *
           IF UGSI-TRAZA   NOT = CT-P
              MOVE LENGTH OF WS-CONTENIDO-TS    TO WS-LONG-TS

              EXEC CICS WRITEQ TS
                    QUEUE  (WS-NOMBRE-COLA-TS)
                    FROM   (WS-CONTENIDO-TS)
                    LENGTH (WS-LONG-TS)
                    NOHANDLE
              END-EXEC

              MOVE SPACES                       TO WS-CONTENIDO-TS
           END-IF.
      *
      *================================================================*
      *                        3000-FINAL                              *
      *================================================================*
       3000-FINAL.
      *
           EXEC CICS
                RETURN
           END-EXEC.
